 "subs": [
  {
   "a": 0.55,
   "b": 3.337,
   "zh": "这是 Anthropic 官方放出的一段对谈",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 3.387,
   "b": 6.68,
   "zh": "主角是 Claude Code 团队的三位工程师",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 7.211,
   "b": 8.711,
   "zh": "负责提问的是 Thariq",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 9.236,
   "b": 11.515,
   "zh": "另外两位是 Sid 和 Robert",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 11.565,
   "b": 13.576,
   "zh": "Robert 正在做 Claude Tag",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 14.1,
   "b": 15.349,
   "zh": "做 Claude Code 的人",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 15.399,
   "b": 16.93,
   "zh": "自己怎么用 Claude Code？",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 17.52,
   "b": 18.812,
   "zh": "答案先放在前面",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 18.862,
   "b": 21.88,
   "zh": "他们已经不给它下指令了，只给目标",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 22.401,
   "b": 23.441,
   "zh": "这句话站得住吗？",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 24.031,
   "b": 26.072,
   "zh": "站得住，但有一个前提",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 26.122,
   "b": 28.581,
   "zh": "模型得先好到，让人敢放手",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 29.104,
   "b": 29.892,
   "zh": "分三步看",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 29.942,
   "b": 33.455,
   "zh": "第一，人怎么从盯过程，变成只给目标",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 33.505,
   "b": 37.438,
   "zh": "第二，做出来的功能，为什么要随时准备删",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 37.488,
   "b": 39.534,
   "zh": "第三，人最后还剩什么",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 40.157,
   "b": 40.617,
   "zh": "第一步",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 41.177,
   "b": 42.458,
   "zh": "Sid 七八成的工作",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 42.508,
   "b": 45.057,
   "zh": "都在 Slack 里的 Claude Tag 上完成",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 46.662,
   "b": 48.662,
   "zh": "以前在意每一次工具调用、",
   "en": "caring about each individual tool call",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 48.662,
   "b": 51.162,
   "zh": "模型做的每一个决定；",
   "en": "and each individual decision that the model makes",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 51.162,
   "b": 56.462,
   "zh": "现在退远一步：我有一个目标，我想把它达成。",
   "en": "to just zoomed out view of like, I have a goal and I'd like to achieve this goal.",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 57.162,
   "b": 60.762,
   "zh": "然后把这个目标交给模型，让它替你完成。",
   "en": "And you just kind of give that goal to the model to achieve for you.",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 61.232,
   "b": 62.888,
   "zh": "这一步只要记住一句",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 62.938,
   "b": 65.732,
   "zh": "交给它一个目标，步骤让它自己排",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 66.332,
   "b": 69.152,
   "zh": "第二步，功能为什么要随时准备删",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 69.652,
   "b": 73.652,
   "zh": "给它五件事，做完三件就放弃了。",
   "en": "You'd give it like five things to do and it would do three things and just give up.",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 74.252,
   "b": 77.652,
   "zh": "我们就想：要不给它一张待办清单？效果很好。",
   "en": "So we were like, oh, maybe you give it a to-do list and it'll do really well.",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 77.652,
   "b": 81.852,
   "zh": "可一年后，它就消失了，待办清单已经用不上了。",
   "en": "But a year from then, it's disappeared. You don't really need the to-do list anymore.",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 81.852,
   "b": 86.952,
   "zh": "你得对自己做的东西毫不留恋，",
   "en": "…you got to be very unattached to the things you're building",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 86.952,
   "b": 89.752,
   "zh": "因为它们很快就会消失。",
   "en": "because they're going to go away fairly quickly.",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 90.222,
   "b": 92.512,
   "zh": "底层模型，每两个月就换一次",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 93.092,
   "b": 94.465,
   "zh": "Thariq 的说法是—",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 94.515,
   "b": 94.652,
   "zh": "—",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 95.155,
   "b": 100.655,
   "zh": "某种程度上，我们就是软件开发未来的「精神时光屋」。",
   "en": "So I think in some ways, we're this hyperbolic time chamber of where software development is going.",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 101.125,
   "b": 102.447,
   "zh": "这一步记住一句",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 102.497,
   "b": 105.585,
   "zh": "今天救命的功能，明年可能就是包袱",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 106.156,
   "b": 108.126,
   "zh": "第三步，人最后还剩什么",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 108.696,
   "b": 110.136,
   "zh": "以前审代码是这样的—",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 110.186,
   "b": 110.286,
   "zh": "—",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 110.789,
   "b": 114.489,
   "zh": "审代码的人会挑出三个小毛病发上去，",
   "en": "and they would pick out three little nitpicks to post.",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 114.789,
   "b": 118.489,
   "zh": "其实就是在告诉你：这段代码我看过了。",
   "en": "It was kind of just like, I'm signaling to you that I read this code.",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 118.489,
   "b": 123.889,
   "zh": "现在，这些小问题可以交给 Claude 自己找、自己改。",
   "en": "Now, you can have Claude figure out those little things and address them autonomously.",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 124.289,
   "b": 127.189,
   "zh": "这已经不是人审代码的重点了。",
   "en": "That's not really the important part of human code review anymore.",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 127.659,
   "b": 130.715,
   "zh": "现在，人只盯 Claude 没想明白的",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 130.765,
   "b": 133.269,
   "zh": "接口怎么设计，边界划在哪",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 133.839,
   "b": 135.285,
   "zh": "在 Claude Tag 里",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 135.335,
   "b": 136.926,
   "zh": "连它每一步在想什么",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 136.976,
   "b": 137.839,
   "zh": "都看不到了",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 138.341,
   "b": 141.641,
   "zh": "这层抽象，一开始有点吓人。",
   "en": "And that abstraction was like a little scary to get through at first.",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 141.741,
   "b": 144.841,
   "zh": "我看不到 Claude 当下在想的每一件事。",
   "en": "I can't see everything that Claude is thinking as it's thinking it.",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 144.841,
   "b": 148.641,
   "zh": "就像被逼着放手，让它自己发挥。",
   "en": "And like being forced even to let Claude cook.",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 149.091,
   "b": 150.528,
   "zh": "回到开头那个判断",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 150.578,
   "b": 153.686,
   "zh": "站得住，因为模型已经好到让人敢放手",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 153.736,
   "b": 157.216,
   "zh": "模型每两个月换一次，你搭的流程迟早要拆",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 157.266,
   "b": 160.188,
   "zh": "能留下来的，只有你给它的那个目标",
   "kind": "nar"
  }
 ],
